{"text": "The cart runs to the flag with cheap effort: one big push, a quick arrival, and a small overshoot, about a quarter of a metre. Now the price of effort rises a thousandfold. The push shrinks, the trip stretches out, but look at the overshoot label: it stays near twenty-five centimetres. Then effort gets cheap: the pushes are huge, the trip is short, and the overshoot is still the same. The price of effort sets the pace, not the shape.", "lang": "en", "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural", "duration": 29.3, "words": [[0.113, 0.188, "The"], [0.188, 0.525, "cart"], [0.525, 0.875, "runs"], [0.875, 0.963, "to"], [0.963, 1.05, "the"], [1.062, 1.538, "flag"], [1.538, 1.688, "with"], [1.688, 2.0, "cheap"], [2.013, 2.388, "effort"], [2.9, 3.137, "one"], [3.138, 3.438, "big"], [3.45, 4.013, "push"], [4.162, 4.225, "a"], [4.237, 4.525, "quick"], [4.525, 5.1, "arrival"], [5.55, 5.612, "and"], [5.612, 5.65, "a"], [5.65, 6.025, "small"], [6.025, 6.575, "overshoot"], [6.987, 7.2, "about"], [7.2, 7.25, "a"], [7.263, 7.688, "quarter"], [7.688, 7.737, "of"], [7.737, 7.775, "a"], [7.775, 8.225, "metre"], [8.625, 8.762, "Now"], [8.762, 8.85, "the"], [8.85, 9.213, "price"], [9.213, 9.287, "of"], [9.287, 9.688, "effort"], [9.85, 10.35, "rises"], [10.363, 10.4, "a"], [10.412, 11.325, "thousandfold"], [11.725, 11.825, "The"], [11.825, 12.15, "push"], [12.162, 12.912, "shrinks"], [13.125, 13.225, "the"], [13.238, 13.513, "trip"], [13.512, 14.05, "stretches"], [14.05, 14.363, "out"], [14.625, 14.8, "but"], [14.812, 14.988, "look"], [15.0, 15.062, "at"], [15.062, 15.175, "the"], [15.287, 15.938, "overshoot"], [15.95, 16.312, "label"], [16.762, 16.837, "it"], [16.837, 17.212, "stays"], [17.225, 17.363, "near"], [17.363, 17.988, "twenty-five"], [17.988, 18.788, "centimetres"], [19.2, 19.363, "Then"], [19.425, 19.8, "effort"], [19.812, 20.087, "gets"], [20.087, 20.5, "cheap"], [20.962, 21.05, "the"], [21.05, 21.45, "pushes"], [21.45, 21.55, "are"], [21.55, 22.25, "huge"], [22.512, 2